{"sec": "sec:Signs the loop has stalled", "blocks": [{"id": "blk:Signs the loop has stalled/1", "kind": "item", "range": [8668, 8809], "text": "The gap between releases is growing. Something has become expensive. Usually it is a\n  missing gate: the agent is hand-checking things.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "The gap between releases is growing.", "words": ["The", "gap", "between", "releases", "is", "growing"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "Something has become expensive.", "words": ["Something", "has", "become", "expensive"]}, {"n": 3, "text": "Usually it is a\n  missing gate: the agent is hand-checking things.", "words": ["Usually", "it", "is", "a", "missing", "gate", "the", "agent", "is", "hand-checking", "things"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Signs the loop has stalled/1.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/1.1.1", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/1.1.2", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/1.1.3", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/1.1.4", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/1.1.5", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/1.1.6"]}], "uid": "mab-11:b63"}, {"id": "blk:Signs the loop has stalled/2", "kind": "item", "range": [8810, 8932], "text": "Your memos are getting longer and less specific. You have stopped using the thing and\n  started theorising about it.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Your memos are getting longer and less specific.", "words": ["Your", "memos", "are", "getting", "longer", "and", "less", "specific"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "You have stopped using the thing and\n  started theorising about it.", "words": ["You", "have", "stopped", "using", "the", "thing", "and", "started", "theorising", "about", "it"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.1", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.2", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.3", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.4", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.5", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.6", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.7", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/2.1.8"]}], "uid": "mab-11:b64"}, {"id": "blk:Signs the loop has stalled/3", "kind": "item", "range": [8933, 9043], "text": "The agent has stopped asking questions. It is guessing. Ask for the questions\n  explicitly, every round.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "The agent has stopped asking questions.", "words": ["The", "agent", "has", "stopped", "asking", "questions"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "It is guessing.", "words": ["It", "is", "guessing"]}, {"n": 3, "text": "Ask for the questions\n  explicitly, every round.", "words": ["Ask", "for", "the", "questions", "explicitly", "every", "round"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Signs the loop has stalled/3.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/3.1.1", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/3.1.2", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/3.1.3", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/3.1.4", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/3.1.5", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/3.1.6"]}], "uid": "mab-11:b65"}, {"id": "blk:Signs the loop has stalled/4", "kind": "item", "range": [9044, 9131], "text": "Release notes have become one line. Nobody will be able to reconstruct this week.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Release notes have become one line.", "words": ["Release", "notes", "have", "become", "one", "line"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "Nobody will be able to reconstruct this week.", "words": ["Nobody", "will", "be", "able", "to", "reconstruct", "this", "week"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Signs the loop has stalled/4.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/4.1.1", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/4.1.2", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/4.1.3", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/4.1.4", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/4.1.5", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/4.1.6"]}], "uid": "mab-11:b66"}, {"id": "blk:Signs the loop has stalled/5", "kind": "item", "range": [9132, 9298], "text": "You are reviewing plans rather than software. The plan is not the product, and a\n  plan reviewed is a plan that has consumed a round without producing evidence.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "You are reviewing plans rather than software.", "words": ["You", "are", "reviewing", "plans", "rather", "than", "software"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "The plan is not the product, and a\n  plan reviewed is a plan that has consumed a round without producing evidence.", "words": ["The", "plan", "is", "not", "the", "product", "and", "a", "plan", "reviewed", "is", "a", "plan", "that", "has", "consumed", "a", "round", "without", "producing", "evidence"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1.1", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1.2", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1.3", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1.4", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1.5", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1.6", "wrd:Signs the loop has stalled/5.1.7"]}], "uid": "mab-11:b67"}, {"id": "blk:Signs the loop has stalled/6", "kind": "rule", "range": [9300, 9303], "text": "---", "uid": "mab-11:b68"}]}
